c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ The publication form: underlined keywords, strings in quotes
that nest, symbols of the Revised Report;
b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ i, total count; B̲o̲o̲l̲e̲a̲n̲ b;
    r̲e̲a̲l̲ p̲r̲o̲c̲e̲d̲u̲r̲e̲ half(x); v̲a̲l̲u̲e̲ x; r̲e̲a̲l̲ x;
        half := x / 2;
    total count := 0;
    f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ 10 d̲o̲
        i̲f̲ i ÷ 3 × 3 ≠ i ∧ ¬(i ≥ 8) t̲h̲e̲n̲ total count := total count + i ↑ 2;
    b := total count > 90 ∨ f̲a̲l̲s̲e̲;
    i̲f̲ b ≡ t̲r̲u̲e̲ t̲h̲e̲n̲ g̲o̲ t̲o̲ done;
    outstring(1, `missed');
done: outstring(1, `total `count' ');
    outinteger(1, total count); outreal(1, half(3));
    i̲f̲ b t̲h̲e̲n̲ outstring(1, `true')
e̲n̲d̲ of the program
